  "description": "DEVELOPED FOR MODERN CROSS-COUNTRY\n\nCross-country racing has evolved. Courses are faster, more technical and more demanding than ever before. That's why the XR platform features 120 mm of travel, progressive geometry and a suspension system designed to perform on both steep climbs and technical descents.\n\nThe result: more traction, more control and more speed across every section of the trail.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT CARBON FRAME FOR MAXIMUM EFFICIENCY\n\nIn cross-country racing, every watt matters. The XR is built around a lightweight carbon frame engineered to deliver the ideal balance of stiffness, efficiency and ride quality.\n\nEvery pedal stroke is converted into forward momentum, helping you accelerate faster, climb more efficiently and maintain speed with less effort.\n\nWhether you're chasing a podium finish or your next personal best, the XR is built to help you unlock your full potential.\n\nRACING DNA FOR AMBITIOUS RIDERS\n\nThe athletes of the Lapierre PXR Racing Team know exactly what modern XC racing demands. Their experience from training camps, World Cup races and countless hours on the bike directly influenced the development of the XR.\n\nThe result is not a World Cup-only machine reserved for elite athletes, but a race-inspired platform designed for ambitious riders who want to benefit from genuine racing DNA, with specifications and performance that make sense in the real world.\n\nBUILT FOR XC RACING, MARATHONS AND FAST TRAILS\n\nWhether you're lining up for an XCO race, taking on a marathon event or pushing the pace on your local trails, the Lapierre XR feels right at home.\n\nWith full 29-inch wheels, modern geometry and a balanced suspension platform, it delivers the perfect combination of climbing efficiency, descending confidence and all-day speed.",
